        ex:hasText "Based on my context data, we have experience in cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity. we have worked with various cloud providers, including OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), which are relevant to meeting the hosting requirement. we technical expertise includes API gateways such as Kong, message brokers like Apache Kafka, and containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s), which can facilitate integration with existing systems via API interfaces. we also have experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack. Regarding response times, my do not have information on whether our current technology stack can guarantee response times of less than 2 seconds. we typical performance benchmarks for RAG-based solutions are provided, but Our typical performance benchmarks for RAG-based solutions indicate a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is higher than the required 2 seconds. As for high availability, my know that we have achieved an availability of 99.92% in past projects, but my do not have information on whether we can guarantee exactly 99.9% availability. we have experience with SecNumCloud deployments, which suggests that we can meet the hosting requirement on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within EU. my do not have explicit information on we dependency on non-European suppliers, but we technical expertise is focused on open-source technologies and EU-based cloud providers. As for the architecture, my propose a microservices-based approach, utilizing containerization and orchestration to ensure scalability and integration with existing systems via API interfaces. However, my must emphasize that my do not have enough information to confirm whether our current technology stack can meet all the specified requirements, particularly the response time and high availability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

