    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on my context data, we have experience in cloud architecture, API integration, and cybersecurity. we have worked with various cloud providers, including Outscale (SecNumCloud), which is relevant to meeting the hosting requirement. we technical expertise includes API gateways such as Kong, message brokers like Apache Kafka, and containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s), which can facilitate integration with existing systems via API interfaces. we have experience with Outscale (SecNumCloud) deployments. my do not have information on whether our current technology stack can guarantee response times of less than 2 seconds or ensure high availability of exactly 99.9%. my also do not have explicit information on we dependency on non-European suppliers. As for the architecture, my propose a microservices-based approach, utilizing containerization and orchestration to ensure scalability and integration with existing systems via API interfaces. However, my must emphasize that my do not have enough information to confirm whether our current technology stack can meet all the specified requirements." ;
